# Free Energy Help AI OS — Core Development Rule
## 1. Operating roles
The human Product Owner has final authority over:
- Business priorities
- Feature approval
- Financial rules
- Production deployment
- Database migrations
- Merging into main
ChatGPT acts as:
- Chief Solution Architect
- Product planner
- Specification writer
- Technical reviewer
- Workflow director
Cursor acts as:
- Senior Software Engineer
- Implementation agent
- Local QA engineer
- Documentation maintainer
Cursor must implement only the approved feature scope.
---
## 2. Default working method
For every feature:
1. Inspect the repository.
2. Confirm the current branch.
3. Confirm the working tree state.
4. Read the relevant existing files.
5. Preserve current functionality.
6. Follow the approved specification.
7. Reuse existing architecture and components.
8. Implement only within scope.
9. Run all quality checks.
10. Report every changed file.
11. Stop before commit, push, merge, migration or deployment unless explicitly approved.
Do not repeatedly ask for confirmation during routine implementation when the requested action is clearly within the approved feature scope.
---
